# Bash output: long output collapses in the transcript.
name: bash-output
size: 100x30
args: --permission-mode default
prompt: Print forty numbers
files: ../../../testdata/fixtures/12/app
script: scripts/bash-output.json
parity: TR-09, TR-55
---
ready
wait_for 30s seq 1 40
settle
keys enter
wait_for 30s That printed forty numbers.
settle
checkpoint collapsed
